00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:08.990
Hi everyone, it's Jerry. This is a Round 3
game from the 2016 Tata Steel chess tournament

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:14.540
between Wei Yi, playing on the white end,
and Magnus Carlsen. This is a pairing that

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:19.609
