opening has a tendency to be a bit on the

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:19.350
positional side, or strategic side where play
is non-confrontational...not a lot of pawn

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:26.410
tension. The position does not open up. There
aren't early pawn exchanges. Rather both sides

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:34.750
